What this licence does and does not cover
-----------------------------------------

It covers the records themselves: the descriptions, the links between
entities, the registries and the vocabularies. Those are the authors' own
writing and their own structure.

It does not extend to the papers the records were extracted from. Each record
names its source and links to it; the source stays under whatever terms its
publisher set. A finding states a claim a paper made — it is not a copy of the
paper, and reusing this catalog is not a licence to the underlying work.
